DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssnndd__tt44ddwwaavvee bridge driver allows the generic audio driver, sound(4),
     to attach to Trident 4DWave audio devices.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The ssnndd__tt44ddwwaavvee driver supports the following audio devices:

     ••   Acer Labs M5451
     ••   SIS 7018
     ••   Trident 4DWave DX
     ••   Trident 4DWave NX

